WEBVTT

00:09:00.035 --> 00:09:01.954
And like most people,

00:09:01.954 --> 00:09:07.209
most of the time,
migrants are profoundly ordinary --

00:09:07.251 --> 00:09:11.839
ordinary people
asked to do the extraordinary:

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:15.634
wage your final fight
to stay in this country

00:09:15.676 --> 00:09:20.306
while you are locked up
far away from family, your friends --

00:09:20.347 --> 00:09:22.975
where lawyers are hard to come by.

00:09:24.476 --> 00:09:30.691
To fix this and move toward a world
without immigration prisons,